    "text": "Using a nuclear counter the count rate of emitted particles from a radioactive source is measured. At <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> it was <math><mn>1600</mn></math> counts per second and <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math> seconds it was <math><mn>100</mn></math> counts per second. The count rate observed, as counts per second, at <math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math> seconds is close to:",
